  "slug": "gorealo-first-time-buyer",
  "name": "GoRealo — First-time buyers",
  "description": "Subject: Buying your first home? Start with three questions | Preheader: A calm, practical starting point for first-time buyers.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Buying your first home? Start with three questions</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">A calm, practical starting point for first-time buyers.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0d6755\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://www.gorealo.com/media/site-assets/gorealo-logo.svg\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#0d6755;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">FIRST HOME, CLEAR PLAN</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">You don’t need every answer to begin.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, your first home purchase can feel like a lot to coordinate. A few simple questions can make the next conversation more useful.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">What part of buying feels least clear right now?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirushtide/mailerfox/main/resources/email-templates/gorealo/assets/HomeBUyersSayYes2.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: First-time buyers\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">What payment fits your budget?</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Think about a monthly range that works with your other expenses, not only the home price.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">What funds may you need?</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Down payment and closing costs vary by loan, property, and transaction.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">What timeline feels right?</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">A realistic timeline helps you plan document gathering, preapproval, and your home search.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with one question—budget, down payment, loan options, or timing—and we’ll help you find a place to start.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#0d6755\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/apply-now\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Explore buying options</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#1459d9\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Buying your first home? Start with three questions A calm, practical starting point for first-time buyers. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR FIRST HOME, CLEAR PLAN You don’t need every answer to begin. Hi {{first_name}}, your first home purchase can feel like a lot to coordinate. A few simple questions can make the next conversation more useful. What part of buying feels least clear right now? What payment fits your budget? Think about a monthly range that works with your other expenses, not only the home price. What funds may you need? Down payment and closing costs vary by loan, property, and transaction. What timeline feels right? A realistic timeline helps you plan document gathering, preapproval, and your home search. Reply with one question—budget, down payment, loan options, or timing—and we’ll help you find a place to start. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Explore buying options Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
